d protect those under their care&quot; way too seriously, so from that day on, he was designated as &quot;Black Rose's Vampire&quot; in the entire mage community and the shame stuck until the end... the game ended with him leaving town and taking her with him... so I guess... they are still a thing","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13654-davesknd","name":"Davesknd","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"173"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}